- **Compute.** Our quote for the whole research plan is 800–1,200 A100-hour equivalents, about $1,200–2,700 with storage. The mainline doubles it, for more seeds, replications and larger GPUs where memory requires them. The ambitious scenario adds a 70B organism family, reinforcement-learning attacks at larger scale, and replication on a second model family.
- **Scope of each scenario.** The minimal scenario covers Papers A and C only. All spending on compute is quoted per phase and approved before it happens.

